{#
  SPLASH — Figma 1404:67411 (rest) and 1407:67433 (card hovered).

  A cover over the homepage on arrival: the introduction on the left and,
  on the right, a postcard of the visitor's sky right now (scripts/v4-splash.js
  works it out from their time zone and clock, sun glow included). At rest
  the card wobbles now and then to invite a touch; hovered (tapped on touch,
  focused from the keyboard) it turns upright, grows, and shows the hour
  track: the sun's real path through the day, crossing the horizon at sunrise
  and sunset, with a dot to drag.

  Any scroll, swipe or page key slides the cover up and the homepage below
  plays its entrance; "See My Work" does the same, then goes to Works.

  Shown only when the head script set html.has-splash (homepage, arriving
  fresh: no #anchor, not a back/forward visit). Without that, or if the
  script never starts, it stays out of the way (_splash.css).
#}
<section class="v4-splash" data-splash aria-label="Welcome">
  <div class="v4-splash__inner">
    <div class="v4-splash__intro">
      <p class="v4-splash__hello">Hi I’m <b>Pari</b> - a</p>
      <h2 class="v4-splash__title">Product<br>Designer</h2>
      <p class="v4-splash__lede">I make complex products simple to use.</p>
      <a class="v4-splash__cta" href="#work" data-splash-cta>See My Work <span class="v4-splash__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span></a>
    </div>

    <figure class="v4-splash__card" data-splash-card tabindex="0" aria-label="Your sky right now. Open it to see the sky at other times.">
      <div class="v4-splash__sky">
        <span class="v4-splash__time" data-splash-time aria-live="polite">12:00</span>
        <div class="v4-splash__control">
          <div class="v4-splash__slider">
            <label for="splash-hour">Hour</label>
            <div class="v4-splash__track">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 1440 100" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <line class="v4-splash__horizon" x1="0" y1="50" x2="1440" y2="50"></line>
                <path class="v4-splash__path" data-splash-path d="M0 96 C360 96 480 4 720 4 C960 4 1080 96 1440 96"></path>
              </svg>
              <span class="v4-splash__knob" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <input class="v4-splash__hour" id="splash-hour" type="range" min="0" max="1439" step="5" value="720">
            </div>
          </div>
          <button class="v4-splash__now" type="button" data-splash-now aria-pressed="true">Now</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <figcaption class="v4-splash__caption">
        <span>In case you’re too busy to look up, this is your sky right now!</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true">You can see the sky in other times, by dragging the handle.</span>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>
